	(text "235 uF, 80 V: 5 x Panasonic EEH-ZC1K470P hybrid, 36 mOhm, 10 x 10.2 mm, active line (rev B5: the APZ 68 uF is obsolete); the fifth is in block 10d. The drives have their own bulk. VBUS peaks about 58 V: 27 % margin. Regen overshoot about 0.8 V before the clamp acts."
