	(text "Same controller as the bank, so one part family. -2 retries on its own: a compute fault does not\nneed a BMS cycle. UVLO on VIN, OVLO low: on whenever the pack is.\nPower-limit start, no dV/dt network: 70 W limit (Rs 5 mOhm, same equation as U1), about 1.3 A at\nfull pack. 4.4 uF plus the brick's own input caps (not published) charges in under 1 ms at 20 uF.\nTimer 100 nF: 4.7 ms typ, 3.1-8 ms. Limit 9.7-12.3 A clears the converter's worst draw, about 4.2 A\nat 36 V. It charges about 48 uF at the converter end plus the DVE's unpublished internal capacitance\nat the low power limit.\nFault check: 87 W is 1.6 A for up to 3.8 ms, against 12 A at 10 ms on the datasheet SOA. Q7 is the\nlinear FET for that reason.\nCompute is on whenever the BMS is on. Loss at 3 A: 0.05 W shunt, 0.03 W FET."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 240 486 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d407e5c8-0669-59d5-a107-b7701b9eed76")
	)
	(text "6. Limb ports: 1.5 mOhm shunt, own breaker (block 6a), meter, soldered pigtail pair. Pigtail fuses inline."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 645 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b480395b-263f-531b-8612-51cda5c63a97")
	)
