	(text "1.5 mOhm: 45 A is 68 mV, ADCRANGE 0. 0.6 W at 20 A.\nEach limb's + and return leave on one soldered pair, twisted from the board edge. No GND studs.\nAux and legs DNP: fit the same parts when they arrive (legs on rev C).\nU12 reads the R arm port input, so it shows VBUS with every port off; the other meters read their port outputs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 645 280 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e949c799-b468-5562-93e0-957ecd6a45ab")
	)
	(text "7. E-stop bank A: second series bank, own driver, ahead of bank B"
