	(text "Rev B4 review: two more absorber cans (three in all). U2 feed 22R and series ES1D. FLT diode BAT46W (pull-down only). 68 V zener on U17 VBUS. 220R in Q12's\ndrain. U8 sense RC placeholder: 0R fitted, 1 nF DNP. Schottky on SPARE_ON (and D5 on SPARE_SW). VBUS bleeder footprint, DNP: fit it only if the drives don't\nbleed the bus. Fuses on the Jetson, Pi buck and fan outputs (the DVE limits at about 30 A). SMBJ15A on +12V: servo back-feed clamp, 16.7 V min breakdown, so it\nnever conducts at 12 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 700 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "399c29db-668f-5e44-b721-235b177cfdb9")
	)
	(symbol
		(lib_id "Connector_Generic:Conn_01x02")
		(at 199.39 660.4 0)
